  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(1)/(4) + ([(20.35)² - (8.35)²] times 0.0175)/((1.05)² + (1.05)(27.65)) = ?\n\n**Formula used:**\n\na² - b² = (a + b)(a - b)\n\na² + ab = a(a + b)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(1)/(4) + ([(20.35 + 8.35)(20.35 - 8.35)] times 0.0175)/(1.05(1.05 + 27.65))\n\n⇒ (1)/(4) + (28.7 times 12 times 0.0175)/(1.05 times 28.7)\n\n⇒ (1)/(4) + (12 times 0.0175)/(1.05)\n\n⇒ (1)/(4) + (0.21)/(1.05)\n\n⇒ (1)/(4) + (1)/(5)\n\n⇒ (5 + 4)/(20)\n\n⇒ (9)/(20)\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (1).**",
